# Terms that must never be committed, for tools/public_check.py. Copy to
# .denylist (gitignored, never committed) and put the real values in.
#
# One term per line. A plain term matches as a whole word, ignoring case, in
# Latin or Persian script (Arabic ي/ك count as Persian ی/ک, harakat are
# ignored). `re:` starts a Python regular expression, matched ignoring case.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are skipped.

# The production host (docs/DEPLOY.md §0)
host-name-of-the-production-machine
203.0.113.10
00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# People, by name — the docs refer to them by role
Firstname Lastname
Firstname
نام نام‌خانوادگی

# The employer whose hardware or name must not appear
re:\bexample corp\b
